%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Epilogue9_5_PostWallFlash
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: <i>Ari stops mid sentence. His face drops.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391639
  - content: <i>Then his posture snaps rigid, his expression neutral.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391639
  - content: Ari? You feeling alright?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391640
    - rid: 314095765763391651
    - rid: 8385543117129122099
    - rid: 314095765763391650
  - content: <i>Without a word, Ari steps forward, walking towards Jay.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391641
  - content: "Okay, good. Let's mo\u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391642
    - rid: 314095765763391643
    - rid: 8385543117129122097
  - content: <i>Behind Rocky, three other scouts step forward. Then two more brush
      past him, moving in perfect unison.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Hey! Watch it! Keep the formation!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391645
    - rid: 314095765763391646
  - content: <i>They don't react nor speak as they march towards the darkness.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391647
  - content: Stand down! That's an order!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391648
  - content: ...Their faces.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391652
    - rid: 314095765763391655
    - rid: 314095765763391654
    - rid: 314095765763391653
    - rid: 314095765763391656
    - rid: 8385543117129122100
  - content: "<i>Jay grabs Ari\u2019s arm, turning him around. His eyes are vacant,
      glowing a faint, milky purple.</i>"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391657
  - content: "What the\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391658
  - content: "It\u2019s... The Princess Frog."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391659
    - rid: 314095765763391660
  - content: Answers, what does that mean?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391662
    - rid: 314095765763391675
    - rid: 314095765763391664
    - rid: 314095765763391663
    - rid: 314095765763391665
    - rid: 8385543117129122101
    - rid: 8385543117129122108
  - content: "Look at Ari. And the others. They all have crystals growing on them.
      They\u2019re the ones you rescued, right?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391666
  - content: 'Yeah... I suppose they are. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The Frog controls Waste creatures. I didn't realize... that meant <i>them</i>
      too.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 8385543117129122109
  - content: <i>Ari breaks free from Jay's hold, and continues marching up the tunnels.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391670
  - content: "Then we\u2019ve got to move. Jackie, what\u2019s the read, are they
      heading to the frog? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391671
  - content: 'Yeah... they are, forwards and up. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Then that\u2019s where we\u2019re going. Everyone on me! \r\n"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 8385543117129122102
    - rid: 8385543117129122103
    - rid: 8385543117129122104
    - rid: 8385543117129122110
